# Credit-Wise Loan System

A machine learning project that analyzes loan applicant data and predicts
[loan approval / credit risk / loan repayment outcome]. Built with Python,
pandas, NumPy, scikit-learn, Matplotlib,seaborn,different Machine Learning models. 

## Project Overview

This project uses applicant and loan information to help the applicant is reliable for loan or not.
The model predicts based on features such as
[examples: income, credit history, loan amount, employment status].


## Features

- Data cleaning and preprocessing
- Exploratory data analysis and visualizations
-Feature Engineering and Encoding

- Evaluation using [accuracy, precision, recall, F1-score, ROC-AUC, etc.]


## Tools and Libraries

- Python
- pandas and NumPy
- scikit-learn
- Matplotlib and Seaborn
-different Machine learing Model
-Testing and Training Model
